s=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.836em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>RPD 值</th>\n<th>预测能力</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>&lt; 1.5</td>\n<td>不可用</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>1.5-2.0</td>\n<td>粗略区分</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>2.0-3.0</td>\n<td>定量预测可接受</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&gt; 3.0</td>\n<td>精确定量预测</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"激光雷达基础\">激光雷达基础</h3><p>农业 LiDAR 按平台和技术分为：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>类型</th>\n<th>点密度</th>\n<th>精度</th>\n<th>典型应用</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>机载 LiDAR</td>\n<td>5-50 pts/m²</td>\n<td>±10 cm 垂直</td>\n<td>林业生物量、地形</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>无人机 LiDAR</td>\n<td>50-500 pts/m²</td>\n<td>±2-5 cm</td>\n<td>作物冠层结构</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>地基 TLS</td>\n<td>数千 pts/m²</td>\n<td>±1-2 mm</td>\n<td>单株表型、果实定位</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>LiDAR 直接测量的物理量包括：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>冠层高度模型（CHM）</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi><mi>H</mi><mi>M</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>D</mi><mi>S</mi><mi>M</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>D</mi><mi>E</mi><mi>M</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">CHM = DSM - DEM</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span></span></span></span></span>（数字表面模型 - 数字高程模型）</li>\n<li><strong>叶面积密度（LAD）剖面</strong>：通过体素化点云并应用 Beer-Lambert 定律估算垂直分层的叶面积：</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi><mi>A</mi><mi>D</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>z</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>ln</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>P</mi><mrow><mi>g</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>p</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>z</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>z</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>G</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>θ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">LAD(z) = -\\frac{\\ln(P_{gap}(z))}{\\Delta z \\cdot G(\\theta)}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.363em;vertical-align:-0.936em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.427em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">G</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mop\">ln</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span><span class=\"mclose\">))</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.936em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>P</mi><mrow><mi>g</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>p</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>z</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P_{gap}(z)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 为高度 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>z</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span></span></span></span></span> 处的间隙率（穿透比例），<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>G</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>θ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">G(\\theta)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">G</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 为叶片投影函数，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>z</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta z</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span></span></span></span></span> 为体素高度。</p>\n<h3 id=\"数据融合方法学\">数据融合方法学</h3><p>高光谱与 LiDAR 数据融合在三个层次上进行：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[数据融合层次] --&gt; B[像素级融合]&#10;    A --&gt; C[特征级融合]&#10;    A --&gt; D[决策级融合]&#10;    B --&gt; B1[&quot;堆叠波段: 高光谱 + LiDAR 派生栅格&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt; C1[&quot;分别提取特征 → 拼接特征向量&quot;]&#10;    D --&gt; D1[&quot;独立模型预测 → 集成决策&quot;]\">graph TD\n    A[数据融合层次] --&gt; B[像素级融合]\n    A --&gt; C[特征级融合]\n    A --&gt; D[决策级融合]\n    B --&gt; B1[\"堆叠波段: 高光谱 + LiDAR 派生栅格\"]\n    C --&gt; C1[\"分别提取特征 → 拼接特征向量\"]\n    D --&gt; D1[\"独立模型预测 → 集成决策\"]</pre><p><strong>特征级融合</strong>是研究中最常用的策略：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>从高光谱提取光谱特征：MNF 成分、PLSR 得分、特定波段指数</li>\n<li>从 LiDAR 提取结构特征：CHM 统计量（均值、标准差、百分位数）、LAD 剖面参数、冠层开度</li>\n<li>拼接两组特征向量</li>\n<li>输入机器学习模型（Random Forest、SVM、MLP）</li>\n</ol>\n<p>融合的增益取决于两种数据源信息的互补性。实证研究表明：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>任务</th>\n<th>仅高光谱 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>R</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R^2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></th>\n<th>仅 LiDAR <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>R</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R^2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></th>\n<th>融合 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>R</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R^2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>地上生物量</td>\n<td>0.72</td>\n<td>0.78</td>\n<td>0.89</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>LAI</td>\n<td>0.80</td>\n<td>0.65</td>\n<td>0.87</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>叶绿素含量</td>\n<td>0.85</td>\n<td>0.30</td>\n<td>0.86</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>冠层氮储量</td>\n<td>0.70</td>\n<td>0.60</td>\n<td>0.83</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>叶绿素含量主要由光谱信息决定（LiDAR 贡献有限），而冠层氮储量需要光谱（氮浓度）× 结构（生物量）的乘积，融合增益最显著。</p>\n<h3 id=\"多传感器时空配准\">多传感器时空配准</h3><p>融合分析的前提是精确的空间配准：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>配准层面</th>\n<th>关键技术</th>\n<th>精度要求</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>LiDAR → 世界坐标</td>\n<td>PPK/RTK GNSS + IMU</td>\n<td>&lt; 5 cm</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>高光谱 → 世界坐标</td>\n<td>DEM 正射校正 + GCP</td>\n<td>&lt; 1 像素</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>LiDAR-高光谱互配准</td>\n<td>基于 DEM 的投影 / ICP 精细配准</td>\n<td>&lt; 0.5 像素</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>时间配准同样重要：高光谱和 LiDAR 应在同一天或接近日期获取，以确保冠层状态一致。对于快速变化的作物（如花期玉米），时间窗口应在 1-2 天内。</p>\n<h2 id=\"练习与思考\">练习与思考</h2><ol>\n<li><p>某高光谱数据集有 200 个波段，80 个土壤样本。如果直接使用全部波段训练 PLSR 模型会遇到什么问题？设计一个结合 MNF 降维和 PLSR 的分析流程，确定最优 LV 数量。</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>比较 PCA 和 MNF 在以下场景中的适用性：（a）高光谱数据 SNR 高（实验室测量）；（b）高光谱数据 SNR 低（高空飞行、薄云覆盖）。解释差异的统计原因。</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>某研究使用无人机 LiDAR 和高光谱估算玉米地上生物量。LiDAR 单独使用 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>R</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>0.75</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R^2 = 0.75</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.75</span></span></span></span></span>，高光谱单独 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>R</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>0.70</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R^2 = 0.70</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.70</span></span></span></span></span>，融合后 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>R</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>0.88</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R^2 = 0.88</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.88</span></span></span></span></span>。分析融合增益的来源：LiDAR 提供了什么信息？高光谱提供了什么信息？</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>讨论快照式高光谱相机相比推扫式的优势和局限。在什么应用场景下快照式是更好的选择？</p>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"拓展阅读\">拓展阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>Aasen, H. et al. (2018). &quot;Quantitative remote sensing at ultra-high resolution with UAV spectroscopy.&quot; <em>Sensors</em> — 无人机高光谱方法论指南。</li>\n<li>Wulder, M.A. et al. (2012). &quot;Lidar sampling for large-area forest characterization: A review.&quot; <em>Remote Sensing of Environment</em> — LiDAR 森林应用综述（方法论可迁移至高秆作物）。</li>\n<li>Ghamisi, P. et al. (2019). &quot;Multisource and multitemporal data fusion in remote sensing.&quot; <em>IEEE GRSM</em> — 多源数据融合的系统综述。</li>\n<li>R 包 <code>hsdar</code> 和 <code>hyperSpec</code>：高光谱数据处理与分析。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>高光谱成像以纳米级光谱分辨率揭示作物的化学组成状态，LiDAR 以厘米级精度重建冠层三维结构。两者的融合——将&quot;光谱维&quot;与&quot;空间维&quot;正交叠加——在生物量、营养状态和早期胁迫检测中产生显著的精度增益。数据降维（MNF/波段选择）、定量反演（PLSR）和多源配准是融合分析的三大技术支柱。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"博士精准农业 — 高光谱与激光雷达融合","id":"博士精准农业-高光谱与激光雷达融合"},{"level":2,"text":"知识要点","id":"知识要点"},{"level":2,"text":"详细讲解","id":"详细讲解"},{"level":3,"text":"高光谱成像原理","id":"高光谱成像原理"},{"level":3,"text":"高光谱数据降维","id":"高光谱数据降维"},{"level":3,"text":"光谱指数与化学参量反演","id":"光谱指数与化学参量反演"},{"level":3,"text":"激光雷达基础","id":"激光雷达基础"},{"level":3,"text":"数据融合方法学","id":"数据融合方法学"},{"level":3,"text":"多传感器时空配准","id":"多传感器时空配准"},{"level":2,"text":"练习与思考","id":"练习与思考"},{"level":2,"text":"拓展阅读","id":"拓展阅读"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"博士精准农业 — 深度学习与作物表型","url":"/l-doc-books/education/phd/agriculture/precision-agriculture/remote-sensing-ai/deep-learning-crop-phenotyping"},"next":{"title":"博士精准农业 — 变量施用技术","url":"/l-doc-books/education/phd/agriculture/precision-agriculture/smart-farming/variable-rate-technology"}}